Package: kernel-autotune
Version: 2.4.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bobby Comet
Depends: bash, procps, coreutils, util-linux
Description: Intelligent kernel tuning with predictable behavior and safety.
 Includes automated SSD detection, NUMA handling, and ZRAM/ZSWAP
 coordination. Version 2.4.0 adds distro, init-system, kernel memory,
 cgroup, PSI, container, ZRAM manager, and power-manager detection,
 plus safer external ZRAM and CPU tuning policies.
